  "evidenceNotes": [
    "Population and grading are separate; membership never boosts a grade.",
    "No forced trait distribution or band quota.",
    "Arm excludes touch/placement and grades functional throwing power, velocity, distance, release versatility, and retention from imperfect platforms.",
    "Accuracy grades repeatable ball placement, not completion percentage alone.",
    "Processing grades recognition, progression, anticipation, and decision quality; it is not an intelligence label.",
    "Mobility combines rushing threat, escape/outside-structure creation, and pocket movement.",
    "Young/active quarterbacks are graded only on demonstrated NFL evidence through the established sample.",
    "Trait-wide audit rejected the first numeric pass as too top-heavy; the ordering was retained where defensible but ordinary starter grades were recalibrated downward so elite bands remain genuinely elite."
  ],
